  "limits": [
    "Only queued followups with no materialized run are editable. Opening the editor does not pause dispatch; started or cancelled messages remain immutable.",
    "One unfinished edit is retained per conversation per tab. Browser refresh recovery depends on sessionStorage, with explicit storage failure guidance.",
    "Editing an existing queue item does not release environment or unresolved-business holds.",
    "Database records preserve prior and new text, original submission receipts and immutable edit receipts. The UI does not yet expose full edit history or rollback.",
    "The enlarged-text matrix covers the editor controls, not a claim of uniform page zoom coverage.",
    "Focused and full counts overlap. No version bump, publication or repeated fresh installation."
